        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zRbac" value="RBAC: END USER BUILT HERE, FOR THE FIRST TIME" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3FAF3;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=1.8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#107C10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="605" width="1380" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rbac1" value="End User role, per persona, per region&#10;STANDING, deliberately - deferred from Part E because these application groups didn't exist until now" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#107C10;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#107C10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="645" width="660" height="65" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rbac2" value="Non-overlapping by region&#10;Same Entra group discipline Labs 11-20 proved prevents the FSLogix lock-violation failure" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#107C10;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#107C10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="780" y="645" width="660" height="65" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zDeferred" value="DELIBERATELY NOT BUILT IN THIS PART" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#605E5C;strokeWidth=1.8;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#605E5C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="750" width="1380" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="defer1" value="Autoscaling (Part H), image pipeline (a focused follow-up), HA/DR (Part H), Intune app assignment (disclosed gap)&#10;None of these are silently assumed done - each is named and pointed at where it actually belongs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#605E5C;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#605E5C;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="790" width="1320" height="55" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zFlow" value="HOW TO READ THIS IN 60 SECONDS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#1F5B96;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F5B96;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="880" width="1420" height="255" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f0" value="1  All 10 host pools use standard host-pool management, per the existing ADR - not Session Host Configuration, re-argued nowhere in this part." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="920" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f1" value="2  CAD's GPU VM size is a placeholder, not a decision - Chapter 17 is explicit that GPU sizing is a vendor conversation, flagged VERIFY, not guessed confidently." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B77300;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B77300;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="960" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f2" value="3  Regional split of the 3,200 total users is an unconfirmed business decision - every host count in this diagram is downstream of that one placeholder number." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B77300;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B77300;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1000" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f3" value="4  Domain join uses a placeholder domain name (northwind.local), deliberately NOT avdlab.local - the two environments stay independent, per the master plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1040" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot" value="Original architecture diagram for this capstone, not Microsoft's. Verified against terraform/capstone-northwind/avd-platform and Part F, August 2026. Self-contained, no remote icon dependency." style="text;fontSize=10;fontColor=#605E5C;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1115" width="1400" height="20" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
